<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 400 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 400 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 400 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    900 MLN    900 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    =	    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1  T-BILLS	=	     74 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p> BAND 1  BANK BILLS   =	    326 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
